[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12060.11, "timestamp": "03:21:00", "text": "因为它在滴答作响，因为它只是……你能吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12062.389, "timestamp": "03:21:02", "text": "好吧，没关系。没关系。它是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12064.309, "timestamp": "03:21:04", "text": "美好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12066.87, "timestamp": "03:21:06", "text": "没关系。他去世了。没关系。好的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12068.389, "timestamp": "03:21:08", "text": "没关系。我们可以，我们可以喜欢这样做"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12072.229, "timestamp": "03:21:12", "text": "这里面有些东西。呃，没有“哎呀”。不，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12074.469, "timestamp": "03:21:14", "text": "不，不。指纹。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12077.67, "timestamp": "03:21:17", "text": "我检查了一些东西。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12080.309, "timestamp": "03:21:20", "text": "我刚刚检查了一下"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12090.469, "timestamp": "03:21:30", "text": "哦。哦，原来是拉神。是的，你是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12092.87, "timestamp": "03:21:32", "text": "其实你很棒。不，不"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12095.95, "timestamp": "03:21:35", "text": "不，不。我拿到矿之后就说了这话。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12099.83, "timestamp": "03:21:39", "text": "错了，所以好的，我们从零个方块中……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12104.229, "timestamp": "03:21:44", "text": "那。我们走吧。是啊，真令人难过。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12107.269, "timestamp": "03:21:47", "text": "我的天啊。别担心。你是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12111.11, "timestamp": "03:21:51", "text": "美好的。你没事。你什么都没做。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12112.15, "timestamp": "03:21:52", "text": "没有什么。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12113.51, "timestamp": "03:21:53", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12115.83, "timestamp": "03:21:55", "text": "我有26美元，我们已经有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12118.87, "timestamp": "03:21:58", "text": "这。我们还需要什么？我们实际上"}]